      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spring_Arbor%2C_Michigan",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Falling Waters Park preserves the site of a Potawatomi village and tells the story of early settlers and the founding of nearby colleges.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spring_Arbor%2C_Michigan",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The township’s artesian springs fed several small lakes, including Lime Lake, whose quarrying left dramatic underwater formations that divers still explore.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21,
