      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spring_Arbor%2C_Michigan",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1833, a spring election in Spring Arbor chose the first township officials, marking the area’s formal organization by the Territorial Council.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
