      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "A planned Village of Spring Arbour in 1833 never materialized after the Free Will Baptists’ seminary moved to what is now Hillsdale College.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
